    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This letter started in England, circled the globe, and found its way to you.</strong><br><strong>Now, it's your turn.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821290/extras/d1aacf38deb02a65d3a9c81e63740c77.avif?t=1754699571\" width=768 height=384 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chain Letter</strong> is a hybrid indie game that weaves rhythm-based action, grid-based defense, and emotional narrative into one unique experience.<br>You play as Mongsil, a girl trapped in a repeating day at Lilico Academy, in the small eastern nation of Corenia.<br>You must deliver a mysterious \u201cchain letter\u201d to your classmates, persuading them to join you and facing down hellish foes as you confront the truth behind the so-called \u201cMiracle of Lilico.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game begins as Mongsil receives a letter and follows a strange bat-cat into a surreal underworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821290/extras/2bc6e4038d85a60af5815cba252e5dfb.poster.avif?t=1754699571\" width=700 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821290/extras/2bc6e4038d85a60af5815cba252e5dfb.webm?t=1754699571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821290/extras/2bc6e4038d85a60af5815cba252e5dfb.mp4?t=1754699571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rhythm-based battles combined with tactical grid-based defense</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit up to 31 classmates through puzzles and choices</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-driven progression and emotional friend stories</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable skill combos using friend abilities</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gradually uncover the truth behind the letter and the \u2018Miracle of Lilico\u2019</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike structure with growth through replay</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>If you choose to ignore this letter,</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>misfortune may follow.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821290/extras/a7fe0089993f7812d4b65921103d3ef0.poster.avif?t=1754699571\" width=700 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821290/extras/a7fe0089993f7812d4b65921103d3ef0.webm?t=1754699571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821290/extras/a7fe0089993f7812d4b65921103d3ef0.mp4?t=1754699571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Where It Begins</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the story of Mo Mongsil, a girl from **Corenia**,  <br>who once experienced a mysterious incident at Lilico Academy.<br>A momentary sequence of events later came to be known as<br><strong>The Miracle of Lilico.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And now, in Mongsil's room,<br>that morning is starting again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821290/extras/db1f171a3396dc9dd60aee76ed8c786a.poster.avif?t=1754699571\" width=700 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821290/extras/db1f171a3396dc9dd60aee76ed8c786a.webm?t=1754699571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821290/extras/db1f171a3396dc9dd60aee76ed8c786a.mp4?t=1754699571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Epilogue</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game began with a phrase from an old internet chain letter.<br>But what if delivering a letter wasn\u2019t a curse \u2014<br>but a symbol of someone trying to connect?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, skills are not just attacks \u2014 they are the strength of friendship.<br><strong>Chain Letter</strong> is more than a rhythm game.<br>It is your journey to persuade, connect, and fight side by side.<br>a small letter that arrived in your inbox on a lonely day.<br>Perhaps it was sent by a mischievous devil,<br>just for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This letter started in England, circled the globe, and found its way to you.</strong><br><strong>Now, it's your turn.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821290/extras/d1aacf38deb02a65d3a9c81e63740c77.avif?t=1754699571\" width=768 height=384 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chain Letter</strong> is a hybrid indie game that weaves rhythm-based action, grid-based defense, and emotional narrative into one unique experience.<br>You play as Mongsil, a girl trapped in a repeating day at Lilico Academy, in the small eastern nation of Corenia.<br>You must deliver a mysterious \u201cchain letter\u201d to your classmates, persuading them to join you and facing down hellish foes as you confront the truth behind the so-called \u201cMiracle of Lilico.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game begins as Mongsil receives a letter and follows a strange bat-cat into a surreal underworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821290/extras/2bc6e4038d85a60af5815cba252e5dfb.poster.avif?t=1754699571\" width=700 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821290/extras/2bc6e4038d85a60af5815cba252e5dfb.webm?t=1754699571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821290/extras/2bc6e4038d85a60af5815cba252e5dfb.mp4?t=1754699571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rhythm-based battles combined with tactical grid-based defense</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit up to 31 classmates through puzzles and choices</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-driven progression and emotional friend stories</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable skill combos using friend abilities</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gradually uncover the truth behind the letter and the \u2018Miracle of Lilico\u2019</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike structure with growth through replay</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>If you choose to ignore this letter,</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>misfortune may follow.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821290/extras/a7fe0089993f7812d4b65921103d3ef0.poster.avif?t=1754699571\" width=700 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821290/extras/a7fe0089993f7812d4b65921103d3ef0.webm?t=1754699571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821290/extras/a7fe0089993f7812d4b65921103d3ef0.mp4?t=1754699571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Where It Begins</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the story of Mo Mongsil, a girl from **Corenia**,  <br>who once experienced a mysterious incident at Lilico Academy.<br>A momentary sequence of events later came to be known as<br><strong>The Miracle of Lilico.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And now, in Mongsil's room,<br>that morning is starting again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821290/extras/db1f171a3396dc9dd60aee76ed8c786a.poster.avif?t=1754699571\" width=700 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821290/extras/db1f171a3396dc9dd60aee76ed8c786a.webm?t=1754699571\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821290/extras/db1f171a3396dc9dd60aee76ed8c786a.mp4?t=1754699571\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Epilogue</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game began with a phrase from an old internet chain letter.<br>But what if delivering a letter wasn\u2019t a curse \u2014<br>but a symbol of someone trying to connect?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, skills are not just attacks \u2014 they are the strength of friendship.<br><strong>Chain Letter</strong> is more than a rhythm game.<br>It is your journey to persuade, connect, and fight side by side.<br>a small letter that arrived in your inbox on a lonely day.<br>Perhaps it was sent by a mischievous devil,<br>just for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
